# --- THE FACES: what a character perceives -------------------------------
# One face per truth, per object. The Examine panel shows ONE of them —
# the one the reader is reading right now — and never the other truth and
# never the other character's reading.
#
# The "tell" is the seam: the one detail that does not add up. It is the
# seed of the Lectura system (GDD.md §6), and it is the only thing the
# player is meant to notice without a marker.

#. TRANSLATORS: The rock in the Reality truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.rock.reality.desc"
msgstr "Une pierre grise de la taille d'un poing, avec du lichen sec sur le dessus et sa base enfoncée dans la terre."

#. TRANSLATORS: The rock in the Reality truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.rock.reality.tell"
msgstr "Elle pèse plus lourd qu'une pierre de cette taille ne le devrait."

#. TRANSLATORS: The rock in the Book truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.rock.book.desc"
msgstr "Un petit livre, relié de cuir brun et sanglé d'une courroie. Les tranches des pages sont dorées et vous tachent les doigts."

#. TRANSLATORS: The rock in the Book truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.rock.book.tell"
msgstr "Il pèse plus lourd qu'un livre de cette taille ne le devrait."

#. TRANSLATORS: The title written on the cover of the book the rock is.
msgid "ui.face.rock.book.title"
msgstr "Le gentilhomme ingenieux Don Quichotte de la Manche"

#. TRANSLATORS: The windmill in the Reality truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.windmill.reality.desc"
msgstr "Un moulin de pierre, les quatre ailes déployées et une porte basse, si usée que la charnière ne ferme plus."

#. TRANSLATORS: The windmill in the Reality truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.windmill.reality.tell"
msgstr "Il ne souffle aucun vent, et pourtant les ailes tournent."

#. TRANSLATORS: The windmill in the Book truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.windmill.book.desc"
msgstr "Un géant de ceux dont on fait les contes, avec des bras si longs qu'ils frôlent le sol et une petite tête enfoncée entre les épaules."

#. TRANSLATORS: The windmill in the Book truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.windmill.book.tell"
msgstr "Ce qui ressemble à un bras sur lui est une aile de moulin."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture of Montiel, the first boss.
msgid "ui.venture.montiel"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel"

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Reality truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.venture.reality.desc"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel, debout. La pierre est polie par le blé, et la basse porte est grande ouverte."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Reality truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.venture.reality.tell"
msgstr "Les ailes tournent vers celui qui regarde, et elles ne tournent pas lentement."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Reality truth: the name the manuscript gives it.
msgid "ui.face.venture.reality.title"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel"

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Book truth: how it looks.
msgid "ui.face.venture.book.desc"
msgstr "Le géant des moulins de Montiel, les bras longs comme des ailes et la petite tête enfoncée entre les épaules."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Book truth: the one detail that does not add up.
msgid "ui.face.venture.book.tell"
msgstr "Ce qui ressemble à un bras est une aile de moulin, et ce qui ressemble à une tête est la meule."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture in the Book truth: the name the manuscript gives it.
msgid "ui.face.venture.book.title"
msgstr "Le géant des moulins de Montiel"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of the guard.
msgid "it.ability.block.name"
msgstr "La garde"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of a Venture's move, in the developer's readout.
msgid "ui.move.mill_sails.name"
msgstr "Les ailes"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of a Venture's move, in the developer's readout.
msgid "ui.move.mill_topple.name"
msgstr "La chute"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of a Venture's move, in the developer's readout.
msgid "ui.move.giant_sweep.name"
msgstr "Le balayage"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of a Venture's move, in the developer's readout.
msgid "ui.move.giant_slam.name"
msgstr "Le coup"

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture's health, in the developer's readout. Format: %s, %d, %d.
msgid "ui.slice.line.venture"
msgstr "%s : %d/%d"

#. TRANSLATORS: The move the Venture is winding up. Format: %s.
msgid "ui.slice.line.venture.move"
msgstr "prépare : %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture of Montiel is over.
msgid "ui.slice.venture.down"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel est tombé."

#. TRANSLATORS: The Venture of Montiel is over — resolved by truth, not force.
#. The knight's delusion held: the world stayed Book, the giant was real,
#. and a fragment of the original book is granted.
msgid "ui.slice.venture.truth"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel se dresse — comme géant."

#. TRANSLATORS: The codex note on the Venture in its Reality form.
msgid "ui.codex.venture.mill"
msgstr "Le moulin de Montiel sous sa forme vraie : pierre, blé, et une basse porte par où l'on entre sans bruit."

#. TRANSLATORS: The codex note on the Venture in its Book form.
msgid "ui.codex.venture.giant"
msgstr "Le géant des moulins de Montiel sous la forme du Livre : l'homme dans le moulin, et non la pierre."

#. TRANSLATORS: The companion, remarking on the Venture.
msgid "dia.quixote.chatter.venture"
msgstr "Un moulin ! Sancho, un vrai moulin, avec sa meule et son blé. N'y touchez pas, car il se défend."

#. TRANSLATORS: The companion, remarking on the Venture.
msgid "dia.sancho.chatter.venture"
msgstr "Ce moulin, seigneur, ne moud pas de blé. Il vient vers nous."

#. TRANSLATORS: The character says so when the world shows them a mill.
msgid "dia.quixote.reaction.venture.reality"
msgstr "C'est un moulin, maintenant. Pierre et vent et blé, et rien d'autre."

#. TRANSLATORS: The character says so when the world shows them a giant.
msgid "dia.quixote.reaction.venture.book"
msgstr "Ce moulin est un géant ! Un géant aux bras de pierre ! Écartez-vous, Sancho, il vient."

#. TRANSLATORS: The character says so when the world shows them a mill.
msgid "dia.sancho.reaction.venture.reality"
msgstr "Ah. Un moulin. Voilà donc ce que c'était."

#. TRANSLATORS: The character says so when the world shows them a giant.
msgid "dia.sancho.reaction.venture.book"
msgstr "Seigneur ! Le moulin est un homme ! Un homme aux bras d'ailes !"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of Region I: El Camino de la Mancha.
msgid "ui.region.camino_la_mancha.name"
msgstr "Le Chemin de la Manche"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of Region II: Sierra Morena.
msgid "ui.region.sierra_morena.name"
msgstr "Sierra Morena"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of Region III: El Toboso y los Montes de Toledo.
msgid "ui.region.el_toboso.name"
msgstr "El Toboso et les Montes de Toledo"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of Region IV: Los Riscos de Medinaceli.
msgid "ui.region.los_riscos.name"
msgstr "Les Falaises de Medinaceli"

#. TRANSLATORS: The name of Region V: El Castillo del Duque.
msgid "ui.region.el_castillo_del_duque.name"
msgstr "Le Château du Duc"
